  SetupScript:
    code: ""
  Description: |-
    Real-time upper garment
    substitution using a reference image.
    
    Add under a ScreenTransform
    
    API
    ===
    
    * enabled (bool)
        Enable/Disable processing and result visibility
    
    * autoRun (bool)
        Enable/disable processing every frame
    
    runMode (int)
      0 - "Adapt to Device Performance" - Automatic choice according to device's performance
      1 - "Optimize Speed" - Always use the lighter and faster version of Garment Transfer
    
    * targetImage (Texture)
        Image/video to which the garment will be applied
    
    * garmentImage (Texture)
        The garment to apply, image/video of a person wearing a garment
    
    * garmentMask (Texture)
       Use this texture as the source garment mask (segmentation) and skip source garment segmentation prediction.
    
    * run() (Function)
        Run processing once (if autoRun is set to false)
    
    * refreshGarment() (Function)
       Force garment image refresh
       This method can be used when a refresh to the garment is desired without changing it.
       Mainly useful when using a video as garmentImage
    
    * isReady() (Function)
      Returns boolean, true when the component is ready for generating results.
    
    * onLoadingFinished   (Event)
    Triggers when the component is ready to generate result isReady() is true.
  VersionMajor: 16
  VersionMinor: 1
  VersionPatch: 0
  ComponentUid: 0006138c-0ec7-03c2-0000-000000115b36
  ExportUid: 07ff2297-652d-4997-ad0c-531d83540996
